Based on the diagnostic results, John Smith's MMS sending issue in France is caused by an undetected outage on the roaming MMS gateway with the current roaming partner (France Telecom). The status bar shows "mms_service: degraded" and the APN check confirms "mmsc_reachable: false" with the specific issue "roaming_mms_gateway_unreachable". This is an infrastructure-level problem on the partner network side that cannot be resolved through device settings or subscription provisioning.

I will now escalate this to a human agent with a concise summary.

